(5122188, 746182, 54645, '<td valign="top">Good luck! Go Love Shack! Technically this is one of the better images as the background is well exposed and full of interesting detail despite a flash going off. Good job.</td>', 'Good luck! Go Love Shack! Technically this is one of the better images as the background is well exposed and full of interesting detail despite a flash going off. Good job.', '2008-12-10 09:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
