(5122200, 746214, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nice pose. Lighting is too harsh for my description of fill flash. The shadows on the back wall are too harsh. This would have been great if done outdoors at a cematary, or a place to mimic a cematary, with a well exposed background and less flash.</td>', 'Nice pose. Lighting is too harsh for my description of fill flash. The shadows on the back wall are too harsh. This would have been great if done outdoors at a cematary, or a place to mimic a cematary, with a well exposed background and less flash.', '2008-12-10 09:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
