(5122506, 745890, 56254, '<td valign="top">gorgeous colors ... well done with the fill flash, it''s hard to tell that you''ve even used it (which is a good thing, IMHO).</td>', 'gorgeous colors ... well done with the fill flash, it''s hard to tell that you''ve even used it (which is a good thing, IMHO).', '2008-12-10 12:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
