(5122637, 745946, 86447, '<td valign="top">Go Love Shack!</td>', 'Go Love Shack!', '2008-12-10 13:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5122641, 746059, 86447, '<td valign="top">This would really be a wonderful shot without the leaf... and naming it ''leaf'' is clever, but... doesn''t change the image.  *grin*<br/> <br/>Still it''s a 6 with me... It would be a 7 or 8 without the leaf since the leaf has no context in the image... WHY is it there hiding her face when there''s nary a tree or another leaf in sight?  <br/> <br/>It''s sharp and well composed... and that bokeh is wonderful.</td>', 'This would really be a wonderful shot without the leaf... and naming it ''leaf'' is clever, but... doesn''t change the image.  *grin* Still it''s a 6 with me... It would be a 7 or 8 without the leaf since the leaf has no context in the image... WHY is it there hiding her face when there''s nary a tree or another leaf in sight?   It''s sharp and well composed... and that bokeh is wonderful.', '2008-12-10 13:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5122667, 746215, 86447, '<td valign="top">This looks to me like backlighting and not fill flash... but maybe I''m misunderstanding the topic...  Fill flash is used to lighten areas that would be in shadow, not create a new light, I think.   I''ll look into it... (not voting yet)</td>', 'This looks to me like backlighting and not fill flash... but maybe I''m misunderstanding the topic...  Fill flash is used to lighten areas that would be in shadow, not create a new light, I think.   I''ll look into it... (not voting yet)', '2008-12-10 13:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
