(5132884, 746194, 90777, '<td valign="top">No vote, just a comment.  A stunning model and great funny title, however, the flash is a little too strong to be a ''fill-in'' (i.e. pop a little light into the shadows and not create its own shadows).  As a result it looks like she is standing in front of a wind machine and a backdrop.  Also the horizon is not straight (but then how many people will be looking at that?)</td>', 'No vote, just a comment.  A stunning model and great funny title, however, the flash is a little too strong to be a ''fill-in'' (i.e. pop a little light into the shadows and not create its own shadows).  As a result it looks like she is standing in front of a wind machine and a backdrop.  Also the horizon is not straight (but then how many people will be looking at that?)', '2008-12-15 17:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5132887, 745852, 90777, '<td valign="top">No Vote, just a Comment.  Well done for achieving a good balance of available light and flash.  One of the few I''ve seen so far that meets the description of ''fill-in''</td>', 'No Vote, just a Comment.  Well done for achieving a good balance of available light and flash.  One of the few I''ve seen so far that meets the description of ''fill-in''', '2008-12-15 17:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5133004, 746067, 35708, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting shot. I like the snow streaks in the sky. The lighting on the tractor is a little off I think but it matches the challenge perfectly. This is really cool. Nice work.</td>', 'This is a really interesting shot. I like the snow streaks in the sky. The lighting on the tractor is a little off I think but it matches the challenge perfectly. This is really cool. Nice work.', '2008-12-15 19:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
