(5133006, 745946, 35708, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Another light on the front side of the barn would have helped in my opinion. The thing I like most of this is the contrast between the barn and the background. Really nice work.</td>', 'Very nice composition. Another light on the front side of the barn would have helped in my opinion. The thing I like most of this is the contrast between the barn and the background. Really nice work.', '2008-12-15 19:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5133008, 745108, 35708, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast of this image. Composition is ok and subject is ok. Lighting is off. But overall I think this image stands out from many of the others in the challenge. So this get a solid 6 for standing out and making me really take notice of it.</td>', 'I like the high contrast of this image. Composition is ok and subject is ok. Lighting is off. But overall I think this image stands out from many of the others in the challenge. So this get a solid 6 for standing out and making me really take notice of it.', '2008-12-15 19:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5133010, 746087, 35708, '<td valign="top">The colors of this image really makes this interesting. Would be better if the support bar on the left were more in the shadow like the one on the right... using a snoot on the fill flash would help that. But I still really like this... again because of the colors and the composition is pretty good. I''m going to give this one a 7. Would have been 6 but I like how original this is. It stands out from all the rest!</td>', 'The colors of this image really makes this interesting. Would be better if the support bar on the left were more in the shadow like the one on the right... using a snoot on the fill flash would help that. But I still really like this... again because of the colors and the composition is pretty good. I''m going to give this one a 7. Would have been 6 but I like how original this is. It stands out from all the rest!', '2008-12-15 19:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5133011, 746208, 35708, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and overall mood. It is different from all the others and stands out. That is a very good thing! Nice work.</td>', 'Very nice composition and overall mood. It is different from all the others and stands out. That is a very good thing! Nice work.', '2008-12-15 19:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
