(5136655, 746184, 90495, '<td valign="top">This is DPC and many didn''t understand what fill flash was so don''t feel that this image isn''t any good, it''s fantastic and fits the challenge to a T.</td>', 'This is DPC and many didn''t understand what fill flash was so don''t feel that this image isn''t any good, it''s fantastic and fits the challenge to a T.', '2008-12-17 09:02:40.000000', NULL, 0),
