(5136795, 746184, 54645, '<td valign="top">Definitely a nice example of the technique, but there is something about her pose or the crop, that creates an uncomfortable feeling. I did not vote on this image, but would have given it a 6.<br/> <br/>I changed my mind, I like the pose/crop. It''s the left eye shadow! I feel so much better now...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-17 10:56:00.</i></td>', 'Definitely a nice example of the technique, but there is something about her pose or the crop, that creates an uncomfortable feeling. I did not vote on this image, but would have given it a 6. I changed my mind, I like the pose/crop. It''s the left eye shadow! I feel so much better now...', '2008-12-17 09:50:34.000000', '2008-12-17 10:56:00.000000', 0),
(5136812, 746018, 67237, '<td valign="top">I am one of your fifty 7''s. Would have been an 8 or 9 with a bit less NR/sharpenning. Still a great shot. Congrats on top 10!.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I am one of your fifty 7''s. Would have been an 8 or 9 with a bit less NR/sharpenning. Still a great shot. Congrats on top 10!. ', '2008-12-17 09:58:39.000000', NULL, 0),
