(5137549, 746047, 23430, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot and thanks for your insightful comments it really showed all the different aspects you thought of and used to make this shot.</td>', 'Fantastic shot and thanks for your insightful comments it really showed all the different aspects you thought of and used to make this shot.', '2008-12-17 15:37:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5137560, 746172, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see the collage!  And it sounds like something I''d do while stuck in an airport, too.  Didn''t vote this challenge but scanned the thumbs and this one caught my eye and got a full view.  I didn''t immediately recognize the location, but it looked familiar.  Thought that was because it looked like something I''d shoot.  :)</td>', 'I''d love to see the collage!  And it sounds like something I''d do while stuck in an airport, too.  Didn''t vote this challenge but scanned the thumbs and this one caught my eye and got a full view.  I didn''t immediately recognize the location, but it looked familiar.  Thought that was because it looked like something I''d shoot.  :)', '2008-12-17 15:42:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5137566, 746161, 30982, '<td valign="top">A perfect 5!  Nice!  It''s either a rock band on stage and their adoring audience, or an evil overlord barking out commands to the peasants.  Either way it works for me.</td>', 'A perfect 5!  Nice!  It''s either a rock band on stage and their adoring audience, or an evil overlord barking out commands to the peasants.  Either way it works for me.', '2008-12-17 15:48:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5137571, 746173, 30982, '<td valign="top">I suspect some saw this more as a main flash rather than a fill, but I''m pleased to see you enjoyed the exercise and learned something from it - I''m too initimated to try flash for anything other than office award presentations, which no one here will ever see!  Lovely flower - I do like the way it sparkles!</td>', 'I suspect some saw this more as a main flash rather than a fill, but I''m pleased to see you enjoyed the exercise and learned something from it - I''m too initimated to try flash for anything other than office award presentations, which no one here will ever see!  Lovely flower - I do like the way it sparkles!', '2008-12-17 15:50:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5137574, 745359, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!  She looks ever so shy, but a wee bit coy.  Pleased to see she posed so nicely for you, too.</td>', 'What a cutie!  She looks ever so shy, but a wee bit coy.  Pleased to see she posed so nicely for you, too.', '2008-12-17 15:51:43.000000', NULL, 0),
