(5137588, 745825, 30982, '<td valign="top">The overhead light trails seem almost like antennas creating a sorta odd alien thing with its mouth open....  Kinda cool!  What you needed was a shark right on top of the tunnel, staring at you.  :-)</td>', 'The overhead light trails seem almost like antennas creating a sorta odd alien thing with its mouth open....  Kinda cool!  What you needed was a shark right on top of the tunnel, staring at you.  :-)', '2008-12-17 15:55:29.000000', NULL, 0),
