(5138850, 746067, 3936, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the yellow!  I was wondering how this image would do in the voting.  Strictly speaking, I did not see this as fill flash; as fill flash is normally understood to be a light to fill the shadows where a subject is back-lit.<br/> <br/>That being said, I gave you a 9, as it is a very strong image.  You definetly captured the feeling of the snowfall.  Excellent job all they way around.<br/> <br/> I''d love to know how you captured the tracks of the snow, using the flash at 1/200.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations on the yellow!  I was wondering how this image would do in the voting.  Strictly speaking, I did not see this as fill flash; as fill flash is normally understood to be a light to fill the shadows where a subject is back-lit. That being said, I gave you a 9, as it is a very strong image.  You definetly captured the feeling of the snowfall.  Excellent job all they way around.  I''d love to know how you captured the tracks of the snow, using the flash at 1/200. ', '2008-12-18 10:05:50.000000', NULL, 0),
