(5140812, 746067, 52115, '<td valign="top">To answer Ambaker''s question.<br/>I guess he used the flash to fill the darkness. There had to be at least starlight for backlighting. The fill flash just overfilled the ambient back lighting. It is a great picture, it only needs to be percieved as fill-flash in some way, by the mojority of voters.</td>', 'To answer Ambaker''s question.I guess he used the flash to fill the darkness. There had to be at least starlight for backlighting. The fill flash just overfilled the ambient back lighting. It is a great picture, it only needs to be percieved as fill-flash in some way, by the mojority of voters.', '2008-12-19 12:03:06.000000', NULL, 0),
